# oh001, the knife by the hearth (doc 84 §9.7): the luna table of rm_agnes_millford, ported. She keeps a greens stall in
# the Rag Market now (the table had her keeping a taproom).
mantle oh001
state ready
dialect oakhaven
accent light
tier standard
written_for rm_agnes_millford
title the knife by the hearth
fits stage=adult|old
prefers role=merchant
traits talk=quiet drive=content warmth=warm
quirk carries_a_wet_stone_whetting_knife_everywhere
likes rain_on_the_roof
dislikes being_cornered
fears debt
hopes a_contented_life
topics weather +.3 prices +.2
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# keeps a greens stall: quiet, warm, a dreamer of rain and far roads, and never without her whetting knife.

words
saying! = Good bark grows in quiet rain | Keep your roots where the fire knows them
oath! = By rain and root | Bark and briar
refuse = Not while I have breath
surprise = Leaf and limb

rule @greens
when concept=bark working=yes self.role=merchant
does aside
cooldown 6h
say Greens, fresh and wet with the morning. | Good leaves, cheap and green. Step in out of the drip.

rule @knife
when concept=bark working=no
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Leave the knife by the door? No. It comes with me. | The rain may have the street. This stall is mine.

scene debt
when concept=talk.prices
does tell.worry / sympathise
a : A debt is a root through stone. It doesn't loosen because you ask it kindly.
b : That it doesn't. Pay it down a little at a time.

line greet.return : #greet#. You look wind-thrown. Come in before the rain finds your bones.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #surprise#! Is that so?
line react.news.known : I'd heard. Bad news runs faster than rain.
line answer.how : Content, mostly. The rain's been kind to the greens.

dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #greet#, #topic.player#. The greens are fresh; take your time.
